# .rooignore — scope menagerie's codebase indexer for the OmniRoute monorepo.
# Honored by RooIgnoreController during the code-index directory scan.
# Goal: drop translated docs, test corpora, and large generated text that
# inflate the indexed "block" count without adding semantic-search value.
# Without these rules the scan parses ~23k files into ~700k code blocks;
# the first two blocks alone remove ~16,600 files (~70% of the index).

# --- Biggest win: translated documentation (~10,200 markdown files) ---
docs/i18n/

# --- Second win: unit test corpus (~6,400 files) ---
tests/unit/
tests/fixtures/

# --- Generated / state blobs ---
.i18n-state.json
*.i18n-state.json

# --- Large env templates (indexed because < 1MB cap, low signal) ---
.env
.env.*
*.env.example

# --- Vendored / bundled third-party code ---
open-sse/vendor/
**/vendor/
